<LegalPage title="Cookie Policy" description="How cookies are used on the AF Construction website.">
<p>Cookies are small text files that websites save in your browser. This Cookie Policy explains which cookies may be used when you visit the AF Construction website.</p>

<h2>Cookies we set</h2>
<p>The AF Construction website itself does not set any cookies. We do not use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies, and the project inquiry form does not store your details.</p>

<h2>Third-party cookies</h2>
<p>Our <a href="/projects/">Projects page</a> includes videos embedded from Instagram. When these videos load, Instagram (owned by Meta) may set its own cookies or use similar technology to remember your preferences, measure use and, if you are logged in to Instagram, link the visit to your account. These cookies are controlled by Meta, not by us. See Meta's Cookie Policy for details.</p>
<p>When you follow a link to Yelp or Instagram, those websites may set their own cookies under their own policies.</p>

<h2>Managing cookies</h2>
<p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Blocking third-party cookies will not affect how the rest of this website works, although embedded Instagram videos may not play.</p>

<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>If we add new features that use cookies, we will update this policy. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last changed.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about cookies on this website? Call AF Construction at <a href={phone.href}>{phone.label}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
